Improved using Qwen.

This repository contains an independently trained PEFT/LoRA adapter for
stanford-oval/churro-3B. It does not contain CHURRO or Qwen base-model weights
and is not an official Stanford OVAL, Alibaba Cloud/Qwen, or Library of
Congress release.

Training and evaluation used public Library of Congress scans and official
page transcripts from the LOC By the People reviewed export. Those source
materials are not redistributed in this package. Consult each LOC collection
record and rights statement before reusing source material.

Generated OCR is unreviewed model output. It is not an official LOC
transcript, reference label, or statement by the Library of Congress.
